{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1468926-eufiber-clothing-in-anima-aeon","id":1468926,"title":"Eufiber clothing in Anima/Aeon","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-26T11:31:58-08:00","id":1468926,"title":"Eufiber clothing in Anima/Aeon","content":"So based on Aberrant Eufiber was everywhere during the Nova Age. While mention has been made that they still use it in the OPNet and other industrial tasks what happed to all the clothing? <br /> Are people still wearing Eufiber clothing? Or was it all destroyed or packed away in attics and the like? It's described as this just awesome cloth that everyone wanted to wear. Without Quantum presumably it's just another type of material to use but socially is it seen as just a no-go to wear something derived from Novas? Or did Project Rewrite remove all mention of it's origin and now to &quot;Joe and Jane Hologram&quot; it's just a material that's around?<br /> <br /> What about Grandpa Nova's old wardrobe that he charged with Quantum and was packed in the attic sense he died in the war? What happens to that? Dose the Quantum just leak out creating a mini blight as it pools? Or dose it just dissipate if it hasn't been worn in awhile? While I would presume that Psions would be able to sense it but with such a small amount not doing anything would it be hard or would they just have to get near it and go &quot;Ya there it is.&quot; And could a hardtech sensor sense it? Dose charged Eufiber count as active? We don't get much info on that but they exist by word of Bunyip:<br /> <br /> &quot;And answering the original question - devices (hardtech and biotech) exist that can sense active psi or quantum signatures within close range. Think of them like metal detectors, placed on entrances and such to pick up if a Psion comes through.&quot;<br /> <br /> But have little info on range just that they aren't that portable.<br /> <br /> This is especially relevant during Anima as it's just after the war and presumably large amounts of it are everywhere, and other quantum based tech but no Psions or Biotech to help with finding it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27184-darrendalca","name":"DarrenDalca","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27184_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-26T11:45:41-08:00","id":1468927,"title":"","content":"I'd imagine it would still be in use. Especially in Nippon which has a lot of &quot;smart clothes&quot; and Eufiber would be ideal for that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4178-stanlemon","name":"stanlemon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-26T14:15:43-08:00","id":1468933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DarrenDalca</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1468926-eufiber-clothing-in-anima-aeon#post1468926\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about Grandpa Nova's old wardrobe that he charged with Quantum and was packed in the attic sense he died in the war? What happens to that? Dose the Quantum ju